<title>FINLAND: STOCKMANN MARCH SALES RISE 12.5 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>STOCKMANN MARCH SALES RISE 12.5 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Oy Stockmann Ab said in a statement on Wednesday its sales in March increased to 642.1 million markka from 570.7 million in March last year.</p>
<p>Stockmann's Q1 sales rose 15.1 percent year-on-year to 1.92 billion markka, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
